  "description": "Na-Hui, who has spent her entire life feeling discriminated against compared to her older brother, still longs for her mother’s love. When her brother brings home his fiancée, she is filled with hope that she might finally become her mother’s number one priority—but an unexpected person appears on the scene...\n\nWhat choices will her mother, Na-Hui, and her new sister-in-law make, and what kind of family will they become?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
